ls or rumors yet on what the third  collaborative experience between Marvel  and EA could be and that is it for  today's Gamespot news how has your  launch weekend for Modern Warfare 2 been  what would you like EA and Marvel's  third title to be let us know in the  comments below and we'll see you here  tomorrow on Gamespot news  [Music]
 

